{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":33060,"duration_api_ms":34983,"ttft_ms":14896,"ttft_stream_ms":1393,"time_to_request_ms":149,"num_turns":2,"result":"{\"verdict\":\"ACCEPT\",\"blockers\":[],\"required_changes\":[\"建议在 §4 明确 LifecycleClosureTrigger 与 derive_question_state 之间的一致性:当 reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=0 时,状态投影应直接允许从 revision耗尽跳到 closure,避免实现时误判进入 REFRAME_REQUIRED 死路\",\"建议在 §7 不变量中显式补一句:reframe 产生的新 root question(不同 lineage_id)不得复用旧 lineage 下任何已消耗的 revision/reframe 计数,防止实现者对 lineage_id 生成算法出现哈希碰撞式复用\"],\"tests\":[{\"test_name\":\"reframe_inherits_lineage_and_consumes_budget\",\"input\":\"policy.reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=2; lineage L1 已有1次reframe(parent_question_id!=null); 提交第2次reframe(mechanism_delta非空,继承lineage_id=L1)\",\"expected\":\"写入question_admission新question_id,lineage_id=L1不变,reframe_budget消耗计数=2,达到上限;第3次reframe请求被确定性gate拒绝(REFRAME budget exhausted)\"},{\"test_name\":\"unrelated_change_must_get_new_lineage\",\"input\":\"对已admitted问题Q1(lineage=L1)提交一个改变机制方向且不再属于原mechanism的ExplorationPacket\",\"expected\":\"确定性校验拒绝将其作为reframe(parent_question_id=Q1);必须作为独立root question写入,生成全新lineage_id!=L1,且不得携带closure_claim=validated的继承声明\"},{\"test_name\":\"holdout_exposure_forces_new_holdout_state\",\"input\":\"已存在有效holdout_reservation R1(未final_run);随后追加holdout_exposure(reservation_id=R1, reason='dataset_leak')\",\"expected\":\"derive_question_state返回value=REQUIRES_NEW_HOLDOUT,reason引用R1的exposure事实;此时不允许追加holdout_final_run(reservation_id=R1)\"},{\"test_name\":\"concurrent_reserve_holdout_rejected\",\"input\":\"两个并发调用ResearchQuestionLedger.reserve_holdout(question_id=Q1, reservation_operation_id=op-A) 与 reserve_holdout(question_id=Q1, reservation_operation_id=op-B) 几乎同时发起,且Q1当前无有效reservation\",\"expected\":\"排他锁保证仅一个成功写入holdout_reservation;另一个因'已有不同operation的有效reservation'被拒绝,不产生重复reservation事件\"},{\"test_name\":\"reserve_holdout_idempotent_retry\",\"input\":\"调用reserve_holdout(question_id=Q1, reservation_operation_id=op-A)两次(模拟重试同一operation)\",\"expected\":\"第二次调用返回与第一次相同的event_key,不追加新的holdout_reservation事件,账本中仍只有一条该reservation记录\"},{\"test_name\":\"policy_budget_closure_requires_both_budgets_exhausted\",\"input\":\"lineage L2: revision_budget.max_per_lineage=3已用满3次proposal_revision,reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=2仅用1次(仍可reframe)\",\"expected\":\"LifecycleClosureTrigger不追加closure(policy_budget);derive_question_state返回REFRAME_REQUIRED而非CLOSED_POLICY_BUDGET\"},{\"test_name\":\"policy_budget_closure_after_both_exhausted\",\"input\":\"在上一测试基础上,lineage L2的reframe_budget也用满2次(总计3 revision+2 reframe事件)\",\"expected\":\"下一次lifecycle fact写入后LifecycleClosureTrigger自动追加幂等closure(closure_reason_type=policy_budget, closure_claim=not_validated);event_key由lineage_id+policy_version+预算快照确定,重复触发不产生第二条closure事件\"},{\"test_name\":\"validated_claim_without_holdout_final_run_rejected\",\"input\":\"提交closure(closure_reason_type=evidence_backed, closure_claim=validated)但未提供holdout_final_run_id字段,且该question无任何holdout_final_run事件\",\"expected\":\"确定性校验器拒绝该closure写入,报错要求validated必须引用同一question的holdout_final_run_id\"},{\"test_name\":\"validated_claim_with_mismatched_holdout_run_rejected\",\"input\":\"提交closure(closure_claim=validated, holdout_final_run_id=hr_999),但hr_999对应的holdout_final_run事件属于另一个question_id Q2而非当前Q1\",\"expected\":\"校验器拒绝写入,因为holdout_final_run_id未引用同一question的final_run事实\"}]}","stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"4efc6573-8218-4f81-b9d4-8056f98ebb4e","total_cost_usd":0.08713630000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5930,"cache_read_input_tokens":6271,"output_tokens":2931,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5930,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2931,"cache_read_input_tokens":6271,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5930,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephe