stion_id=Q1, reservation_operation_id=op-B) 几乎同时发起,且Q1当前无有效reservation","expected":"排他锁保证仅一个成功写入holdout_reservation;另一个因'已有不同operation的有效reservation'被拒绝,不产生重复reservation事件"},{"test_name":"reserve_holdout_idempotent_retry","input":"调用reserve_holdout(question_id=Q1, reservation_operation_id=op-A)两次(模拟重试同一operation)","expected":"第二次调用返回与第一次相同的event_key,不追加新的holdout_reservation事件,账本中仍只有一条该reservation记录"},{"test_name":"policy_budget_closure_requires_both_budgets_exhausted","input":"lineage L2: revision_budget.max_per_lineage=3已用满3次proposal_revision,reframe_budget.max_per_lineage=2仅用1次(仍可reframe)","expected":"LifecycleClosureTrigger不追加closure(policy_budget);derive_question_state返回REFRAME_REQUIRED而非CLOSED_POLICY_BUDGET"},{"test_name":"policy_budget_closure_after_both_exhausted","input":"在上一测试基础上,lineage L2的reframe_budget也用满2次(总计3 revision+2 reframe事件)","expected":"下一次lifecycle fact写入后LifecycleClosureTrigger自动追加幂等closure(closure_reason_type=policy_budget, closure_claim=not_validated);event_key由lineage_id+policy_version+预算快照确定,重复触发不产生第二条closure事件"},{"test_name":"validated_claim_without_holdout_final_run_rejected","input":"提交closure(closure_reason_type=evidence_backed, closure_claim=validated)但未提供holdout_final_run_id字段,且该question无任何holdout_final_run事件","expected":"确定性校验器拒绝该closure写入,报错要求validated必须引用同一question的holdout_final_run_id"},{"test_name":"validated_claim_with_mismatched_holdout_run_rejected","input":"提交closure(closure_claim=validated, holdout_final_run_id=hr_999),但hr_999对应的holdout_final_run事件属于另一个question_id Q2而非当前Q1","expected":"校验器拒绝写入,因为holdout_final_run_id未引用同一question的final_run事实"}]},"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"a86a6d59-5acc-4a32-913a-d630bbbb956a"}
